flowchart TD
  owner["Start here: configured<br/>source boundaries"]:::start
  acquire["Ravel CLI checks origin and capture<br/>outside every confinement"]
  snapshot["Immutable source trees<br/>and directory descriptor"]
  run["Harness run during evaluation:<br/>same read grants and variable"]
  parent["Managed harness: read grants<br/>and its own result context"]
  delegate["Ordinary delegate: same directories<br/>may inherit the parent result context"]
  adapter["Controlled adapter: forward reads<br/>and scrub the parent result context"]
  protected["Configuration directory, settings<br/>and result channels"]
  owner -->|1. canonical boundaries| acquire
  acquire -->|2. publish the complete set| snapshot
  snapshot -->|3a. read-only grants| run
  snapshot -->|3b. read-only grants| parent
  parent -->|4. forward paths, forbid the parent ending| delegate
  parent -->|alternative: measure isolation| adapter
  protected -.->|overlap refuses, never copied or granted| acquire
  classDef start fill:#173451,color:#fff,stroke:#102a43,font-weight:bold
